::  name       layout height ceiling gate
::  shape      height - int (@u32) -> lawful - int (@u32)
::  invariant  answers 1 while the height stays at or under 8; answers 0 past
::  the grid
::  law        brushstroke/skate_cell_grid.rye grid_rows=8
::  example    1 -> 1 - 8 -> 1 - 9 -> 0
::  readers    Brushstroke - Skate - Glow layout
::  nib        glow-language journey Orbit 10 -- layout shapes (20261104)
::
::  A rectangle's height cannot exceed the grid's row count.
|=  sample=@u32
?:  (gth sample 8)  0  1
